  - id: C:policy/conflict-of-interest
    type: policy
    name: Conflict of interest policy
    summary: Individuals report potential conflicts as decisions arise; if the board finds a conflict the conflicted individual does not vote, and the Foundation may drop the transaction. Directors and key employees are also asked periodically to answer a questionnaire (not sent in 2024, planned for 2025).
    scope: board and key employees
    url: https://www.mozillafoundation.org/en/meet-mozilla/annual-reports-and-financials/
    status: active
    visibility: public
    provenance: {mode: net-scan, sources: ['https://stateof.mozilla.org/pdf/Mozilla%20Foundation_Form_990_2024.pdf', 'https://www.mozillafoundation.org/en/meet-mozilla/annual-reports-and-financials/'], confidence: 0.9, state: known}

  - id: C:filing/form-990-2024
    type: filing
    name: IRS Form 990 for 2024
    summary: 'Public disclosure copy; signed 2025-11-17, the extended due date. Part I: 10 voting board members (8 independent), 73 employees in 2024, about 10,000 volunteers (estimate); Schedule R lists the related organizations used throughout this Holotype.'
    kind: IRS Form 990
    period: '2024'
    entity: C:entity/mozilla-foundation
