  - id: C:filing/audited-financials-2024
    type: filing
    name: Audited consolidated financial statements, 2024 and 2023
    summary: 'Mozilla Foundation and Subsidiaries, issued 2025-09-26: wholly-owned for-profit subsidiaries named (the Corporation, MZLA, Mozilla Ventures, MZL.AI), consolidated revenue and support $680.4 million in 2024, net assets $1,405.5 million, and a subsequent-events note on the Mozilla Online arbitration and the Fakespot shutdown.'
    kind: audited financial statements
    period: '2024'
    entity: C:entity/mozilla-foundation
    issued: 2025-09-26
