  - id: C:event/layoffs-2024-11
    type: event
    name: Foundation cuts 30% of staff, advocacy and global programs end
    summary: On 2024-11-04 the Foundation laid off 30% of its employees; its advocacy and global programs divisions were no longer part of its structure. Advocacy continues inside the campaigns the Foundation still runs.
    kind: restructuring
    at: 2024-11-04
    status: active
    visibility: public
    provenance: {mode: net-scan, sources: ['https://techcrunch.com/2024/11/09/mozilla-lays-off-30-of-its-nonprofit-arm', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mozilla_Foundation'], confidence: 0.8, state: known}
